# CLAUDE.md

This file provides guidance to Claude Code (claude.ai/code) when working with code in this repository.

## Quick Start

See `@README.md` for build, test, lint, format, and smoke test commands.

## Critical Project Conventions

**Authentication:** All auth state is server-side. User data via `context.locals.user` exists only in `.astro` pages, not React components. Credentials never reach the client; `createClient()` builds on-demand from request headers and cookies using `@supabase/ssr`.


**Setup & Workflow:**
- `.dev.vars` must be manually created: `cp .env.example .dev.vars` (Cloudflare dev secrets, not in repo).
- Husky + lint-staged auto-lint/format on commit. `npm install` may need workerd/esbuild script permissions (wrangler.jsonc has `allowScripts` set).

**Deployment:**
- Build requires `SUPABASE_URL` and `SUPABASE_KEY` secrets in CI.
- Deploy with `npx wrangler deploy` (wrangler.jsonc has Cloudflare compatibility flags).

## Framework Gotchas

- **TypeScript 6.x** — Stricter; `.any` and unused vars with `_` prefix not allowed by ESLint.
- **Tailwind v4** — New variable syntax, `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin, different config.
- **React 19.x** — Subtle hook/effect behavioral changes; verify dependencies and cleanup.
- **ESLint flat config** — Uses `eslint.config.js` (not `.eslintrc`); rules in flat array.

---

For detailed project layout, tooling config, and ESLint rules, see `@AGENTS.md`.
